# CogniLedger MCP Server — environment variables
#
# v1 has no required environment variables. This server is fully static
# (no database, no upstream API calls, no auth). The variable names below
# are scaffolded for v2 and intentionally left empty.
#
# DO NOT commit a populated .env file to the repository.

# v2 placeholder — operator email surfaced in get_contact_info responses (currently hard-coded in lib/data/contact.ts)
# OPERATOR_EMAIL=

# v2 placeholder — environment label for log filtering ("production" | "preview" | "development")
# DEPLOYMENT_ENV=
